      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785436834711,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Entire Design should be easily scalable\n- New Features (new output device, new way to play songs from PL etc.) can be easily integrate",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
